[0m[0m
After step 1: [38;5;10m*ck2 = 1[0m (old key), [38;5;10m*k1 = 0[0m (was in ck2). kv.key still points to k1.[0m[0m
After step 2: [38;5;10m*cv2 = 10[0m (old val), [38;5;10m*v1 = 0[0m (was in cv2). kv.value still points to v1.[0m[0m
After step 3: kv.key now points to k1b (which has value 1), key (the parameter) now points to k1 (which has value 0).[0m[0m
After step 4: kv.value now points to v1b (which has value 59), value (the parameter) now points to v1 (which has value 0).[0m[0m
[0m[0m
