[0m[0m
[1mrust
[0m[38;5;10mstd::mem::swap(kv.key, key);
[0m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Here [38;5;10mkv.key[0m is [38;5;10m&mut T[0m (a mutable reference) and [38;5;10mkey[0m is also [38;5;10m&mut T[0m. [38;5;10mstd::mem::swap[0m swaps the values they point to. So this swaps [38;5;10m*kv.key[0m and [38;5;10m*key[0m, not the references themselves![0m[0m
